 clean clone

Table 11 said '59 tests, 0 failed'. One of the 59 tests
(test_dedup.py, test_dedup_on_the_real_corpus) needs a corpus that is
only on the author's machine, so a clean clone gives 58 passed,
1 skipped. Measured here at 6d547d0. The total of 59 is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
